rchySubsetMDXSet|HierarchyTimeLastUpdated|HierarchyTopElementInsert|HierarchyTopElementInsertDirect|HierarchyUpdateDirect|NewDateFormatter|ODBCOPENEx|ODBCOutput|ParseDate|ProcessAttrDelete|ProcessAttrInsert|ProcessAttrN|ProcessAttrNL|ProcessAttrPutN|ProcessAttrPutS|ProcessAttrS|ProcessAttrSL|ProcessExists|ProcessExitByChoreRollback|ProcessExitByProcessRollback|ProcessRollback|PublishSubset|RefreshMdxHierarchy|RemoveCAMIDAssociation|RemoveCAMIDAssociationFromGroup|RemoveClientFromGroup|RuleLoadFromFile|RuleLoadFromFileEx|RunProcess|SecurityOverlayCreateGlobalDefault|SecurityOverlayDestroyGlobalDefault|SecurityOverlayGlobalLockCell|SecurityOverlayGlobalLockNode|ServerActiveSandboxGet|ServerActiveSandboxSet|ServerSandboxClone|ServerSandboxCreate|ServerSandboxDiscardAllChanges|ServerSandboxesDelete|ServerSandboxExists|ServerSandboxGet|ServerSandboxListCountGet|ServerSandboxMerge|SetChoreVerboseMessages|SetDimensionGroupsSecurity|SetElementGroupsSecurity|SetHierarchyElementGroupsSecurity|SetHierarchyGroupsSecurity|SetODBCUnicodeInterface|SetOutputEscapeDoubleQuote|SetUseActiveSandboxProperty|SubsetAliasGet|SubsetATTRN|SubsetATTRNL|SubsetAttrDelete|SubsetAttrInsert|SubsetAttrPutN|SubsetAttrPutS|SubsetATTRS|SubsetATTRSL|SubsetElementExists|SubsetElementGetIndex|SubsetExpandAboveSet|SubsetFormatStyleSet|SubsetIsAllSet|TM1User|ViewAttrDelete|ViewAttrInsert|ViewAttrN|ViewAttrNL|ViewAttrPutN|ViewAttrPutS|ViewAttrS|ViewAttrSL|ViewConstruct|ViewCreateByMDX|ViewExtractFilterByTitlesSet|ViewMDXGet|ViewMDXSet|ViewSuppressZeroesSet|ACOS|ASIN|ATAN|CellValueN|CellValueS|CODEW|ConsolidatedAvg|ConsolidatedCount|ConsolidatedCountUnique|ConsolidatedMax|ConsolidatedMin|CubeATTRN|CubeATTRS|DATE|DATES|DAY|DimensionATTRN|DimensionATTRS|DNEXT|DNLEV|ElementFirst|ElementIsComponent|ElementNext|FV|Hierarchy|HierarchyIndex|HierarchyN|INT|ISLEAF|ISUND|ISUNDEFINEDCELLVALUE|LevelCount|LN|MONTH|PAYMT|PV|RAND|TABDIM|TIME|TODAY|UNDEF|UNDEFINEDCELLVALUE|YEAR|ViewRowDimensionSet|ViewRowSuppressZeroesSet|ViewColumnSuppressZeroesSet|ViewSubsetAssign|ViewTitleDimensionSet|ViewTitleElementSet|ViewZeroOut|PublishView|NativeViewToMDX|Break|ExecuteCommand|ExecuteProcess|ItemReject|ItemSkip|ProcessBreak|ProcessError|ProcessQuit|Return|SetInputCharacterSet|SetOutputCharacterSet|Sleep|Synchronized|AddClient|AddGroup|AssignClientPassword|AssignClientToGroup|DeleteClient|DeleteGroup|CubeSecurityPut|DimensionSecurityPut|ElementSecurityPut|SecurityRefresh|Now|Timst|Timvl|DayNo|ODBCOpen|ODBCQuery|ODBCClose|ODBCExecute|ODBCFetch|ODBCPut|ODBCEOF|ODBCError|LogOutput|SaveDataAll|SetUseActiveDirectory|DBR|DBS|DBSS|FileExists|WildcardFileSearch|GetProcessName|ServerRestart|ServerShutdown|ServerLogger|SwapAliasWithPrincipalName|DatasourceQuery|DimensionElementComponentAdd|ElementCount|ElementIndex|ElementName|ElementType|ElementLevel|ElementAscend|ElementDescend|ElementComponentCount|ElementComponent|ElementComponentWeight|ElementIsAncestor|ElementIsParent|ElementIsChild|ElementIsSibling|ElementSecurityGet|ElementParentCount|ElementParent|ElementWeight|ConsolidateChildren|DB|ABS|MAX|MIN|MOD|ROUND|ROUNDP|SIGN|SQRT|EXP|LOG|SIN|COS|TAN|CAPIT|LOWER|UPPER|SUBST|TRIM|STR|NUMBR|INSRT|NOW|DAYNO|TIMST|TIMVL)\\b",
            "name": "entity.name.function.tm1"
        },
        {
            "comment": "System variables / datasource fields",
            "match": "\\b(?i)(DatasourceType|DatasourceNameForClient|DatasourceNameForServer|DatasourceASCIIDelimiter|DatasourceASCIIQuoteCharacter|DatasourceASCIIHeaderRecords|DatasourceView|DatasourceCube|OnMinorErrorDo|OnMajorErrorDo|NValue|SValue|DataSourceLineCount|DataSourceLineCountOk|DataSourceLineCountKo)\\b",
            "name": "variable.language.tm1"
        },
        {
            "comment": "Generic Variables (matches any word that wasn't matched above)",
            "match": "\\b[a-zA-Z_àáâãäåæçèéêëìíîïðñòóôõöøùúûüýþÿßÀÁÂÃÄÅÆÇÈÉÊËÌÍÎÏÐÑÒÓÔÕÖØÙÚÛÜÝÞ][a-zA-Z0-9_àáâãäåæçèéêëìíîïðñòóôõöøùúûüýþÿßÀÁÂÃÄÅÆÇÈÉÊËÌÍÎÏÐÑÒÓÔÕÖØÙÚÛÜÝÞ]*\\b",
            "name": "variable.language.tm1"
        }
    ],
    "scopeName": "source.tm1"
}